
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2
    pe 4
    Cu 0.01
    Ba 0.005
    Cl 1.0 charge
    units mol/kgw

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
    -m 1.0
    -parms 1.0 10
    -steps 1000 in 1000
    -runge_kutta 4

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file result.sel
    -reset false
    -time true
    -molalities CO2
    -totals C
    -step

END
